{title: I Am In Love}
{artist: K K Pritam Once Upon A Time In Mumbai}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Ho aaj kal [G]tanha mai kahan hoon,        [A]saath chalta [D]koi
[D]Uski hame [G]aadat hone ki,        [A]aadat ho [D]gayi
[D]Woh jo mila hai [G]jab se uski,        [A]sauhbat ho [D]gayi
[D]ik zara [G]masoom se dil ki,        [A]aafat ho gai
[D]Sun le zara, [Bm]sun le zara,        [G]Dil ne kaha [A]itna bas [D]muze pata hai
[D]I am in love, [Bm]I am in love,        [G]Tu hi bata [A]jane kya [D]muze hua hai
Ose [D]boondhon mein tu hai, aankhein,        [Bm]moondu mein tu hai
Dishaayon [G]das tu hai, tu hi hai,        [A]bas tu hai
Dil ka [D]shehar tu hai,        acchi [Bm]khabar tu hai
Fursat ki [G]hassi tu hai,        jo bhi thi [A]kami tu hai
[D]Tu hai mera, [Bm]tu hai mera,        [G]Kuch main jaanu na,
[A]itna bas [D]mujhe pataa hai,        [D]I am in love, [Bm]I am in love
[G]Tu hi bata [A]jane kya [D]muze hua hai,        Baadal pe [D]chalta hoon main,
girta [Bm]sambhalta hoon main,        Khwaishein [G]karta hoon main,
khone se [A]darta hoon main,        Jaaga na [D]soya hoon main,
musafir [Bm]khoya hoon main,        Kuch sarfi [G]ra sa hoon main,
budhu [A]zara sa hoon main,        [D]Dil kya kare, [Bm]dil kya kare
[G]Tere bina, [A]itna bas [D]mujhe pata hai,        [D]I am in love, [Bm]I am in love
[G]Tu hi bataa [A]jaane kya [D]mujhe hua hai
